[00:15.50]Nahi jeena, nahi jeena...
[00:31.50]Main tainu samjhawan ki,
[00:35.50]Na tere bina lagda jee
[00:43.50]Main tainu samjhawan ki,
[00:47.50]Na tere bina lagda jee
[00:51.50]Tu ki jaane pyaar mera,
[00:55.50]Main karaan intezar tera
